            %p
              where
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi smap
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{smap}
              is some topologization of the set of maps (defined on their
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/pdf/1010.3336.pdf#page=6"} p. 6
              ) of which all we need to know is that:
            %ol
              %li
                %p
                  (shown on the right of
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:AComparisonMoprphismForShapeOfDiffeologicalMappingSpace"} (4)
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi Cdfflg
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Cdfflg
                  is
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/isomorphism"} isomorphic
                  to the internal hom
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
