            %p
              Hence the claim follows by using
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-out-of-3"} 2-out-of-3
              in the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/naturality+square"} naturality square
              of the natural weak homotopy equivalence from Prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TopologicalHomotopyTypeIsCohesiveShapeOfCdfflg"}
